Essentials Plugins for VS Code

1. Git Lens: Adds inline "blame" annotations showing who last changed each line and when, plus a much richer commit history view than plain Git. Useful once you're working in a team or just want to trace when/why a test broke.

2. Path Intellisense: Auto completes the paths as we type imports.
